sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as TCPServer
    participant P as Parser
    participant B as BrokerCore
    participant D as SegmentFile
    participant M as InMemoryLog

    alt Framed wire v1 (HERBATKA handshake then binary frames)
        C->>S: PRODUCE frame
        S->>P: decode framed request
        P-->>S: Request::Produce
        S->>B: produce(topic, message)
        B->>D: append_to_segment_file(...)
        B->>M: log.append(message)
        B-->>S: offset
        S-->>C: OK offset (frame)
        C->>S: FETCH frame
        S->>P: decode framed request
        P-->>S: Request::Fetch
        S->>B: fetch(topic, offset)
        B-->>S: Option<Message>
        S-->>C: MSG/NONE/ERR (frames)
    else Legacy line protocol (first line is not handshake)
        C->>S: PRODUCE topic payload (line)
        S->>P: parse_request(line)
        P-->>S: Request::Produce
        S->>B: produce(topic, message)
        B->>D: append_to_segment_file(...)
        B->>M: log.append(message)
        B-->>S: offset
        S-->>C: OK offset
        C->>S: FETCH topic offset (line)
        S->>P: parse_request(line)
        P-->>S: Request::Fetch
        S->>B: fetch(topic, offset)
        B-->>S: Option<Message>
        S-->>C: MSG/NONE/ERR
    end
